Package: PeerCRA
Title: Peer-Effect GMM under Conditional Random Assignment
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ying", "Zeng", email = "zengying17@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates endogenous peer effects under conditional random
    assignment across peer groups, with optional own-effect and peer-effect
    covariates. Uses two-step GMM with a quadratic moment and linear IV
    moments, a heteroskedasticity-robust bias-corrected variance estimator,
    an exact analytic objective gradient, and matrix-free block-diagonal
    operators that run in O(sum_r n_r) per moment evaluation. Pure base R;
    no compiled code or external dependencies.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/zengying17/peergmm-r
BugReports: https://github.com/zengying17/peergmm-r/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
